An ordered list carries its authored delimiter

```
1) first
2) second
.
<ol data-delim=")">
  <li>first</li>
  <li>second</li>
</ol>
```

```
1. first
2. second
.
<ol>
  <li>first</li>
  <li>second</li>
</ol>
```

```
c) gamma
d) delta
.
<ol type="a" start="3" data-delim=")">
  <li>gamma</li>
  <li>delta</li>
</ol>
```

```
{k=v .attr}
1) first
.
<ol data-delim=")" k="v" class="attr">
  <li>first</li>
</ol>
```

```
1. outer

   1) inner
.
<ol>
  <li>outer
    <ol data-delim=")">
      <li>inner</li>
    </ol>
  </li>
</ol>
```
